  nodes:
  - message: Rule number 2
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 1
  - message: When you're sitting at the pavilion and the only light that helps you
      see goes out
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 2
  - message: ou must get up and turn the light back on and return to your seat. Also,
      before you sit back down
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 3
  - message: don't forget to turn on the radio. Then, once you have the light and
      radio on
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 4
  - message: return to your seat and wait for the radio to turn off."
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 5
  - message: ahmm
    isPlayer: 1
    replies:
    - replyText: That's enough, I don't want to play anymore. Go die somewhere!
      nextNode: 6
    - replyText: Okay, I've read the rules. What are the other details?
      nextNode: 7
    nextNode: 0
  - message: You can't escape this
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: -1
  - message: It's not difficult
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 8
  - message: You just have to turn on the light and the radio and return to your
      seat
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 9
  - message: Wait until the radio turns off. But the path isn't that simple, is it?
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 10
  - message: f the light doesn't come on, you have to fix it. Simple. As for the
      time, 20:00 - 20:40
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: 11
  - message: May you survive and be safe
    isPlayer: 0
    replies: []
    nextNode: -1
